 "takeaways": [
  "Ester name = **alkyl** (from the alcohol) **+ stem + oate** (from the acid).",
  "The part with **C=O** is the acid part; the part joined to the single-bonded **O** is the alkyl part.",
  "To find the parents: **-oate → -oic acid**, **alkyl → alcohol**."
 ],
